sequenceDiagram
  actor player as Player
  participant web as Browser
  participant server as Game server
  participant db as Database
  player->>web: taps the flag on the question
  web->>player: popover with the problem kinds
  player->>web: picks one
  web->>server: POST /question-reports {match, question, problem_kind}
  server->>db: stores the report
  web->>player: flag shows the question as reported
